    "name": "Timefront",
    "steam_appid": 3328840,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brave the Known World and lead one of five asymmetric races to vanquish your enemies and push back the Timefront. Recruit, combat and expand your territory in this thrilling new take on the old and beloved genre.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cinematic Campaign</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/80d4cb99c7a9c3359f7b8f16c9056dec.poster.avif?t=1750949587\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/80d4cb99c7a9c3359f7b8f16c9056dec.webm?t=1750949587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/80d4cb99c7a9c3359f7b8f16c9056dec.mp4?t=1750949587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself on a rich, character-driven story and fight back against Oroch to reclaim the lands lost to the Timefront. This roguelike campaign will ensure replayability is fresh and engaging in every run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Own Strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/ec70e2181292258bab4cdf770eba01ca.poster.avif?t=1750949587\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/ec70e2181292258bab4cdf770eba01ca.webm?t=1750949587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/ec70e2181292258bab4cdf770eba01ca.mp4?t=1750949587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your race, commander, units and artifacts to customize your own playstyle before the game begins. Tweak your composition after every match to min/max your strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/eab6f97b9d772f943df09783b1d3cc39.poster.avif?t=1750949587\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/eab6f97b9d772f943df09783b1d3cc39.webm?t=1750949587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/eab6f97b9d772f943df09783b1d3cc39.mp4?t=1750949587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills on casual skirmishes against players from around the world. You can take it one step further and try the competitive ladder and tournaments for rewards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Raids</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/32dcff788b32266b5a46d4b81239e491.poster.avif?t=1750949587\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/32dcff788b32266b5a46d4b81239e491.webm?t=1750949587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/32dcff788b32266b5a46d4b81239e491.mp4?t=1750949587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Party-up with your friends or guildmates to overcome difficult scenarios against the AI in this challenging co-op game mode.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Custom Games</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/d1548bc8058e546f583ed6c9598af17d.poster.avif?t=1750949587\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/d1548bc8058e546f583ed6c9598af17d.webm?t=1750949587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/d1548bc8058e546f583ed6c9598af17d.mp4?t=1750949587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Worldshaper, Timefront's game editor, to build your own custom games and publish them. If they become popular with the community, you can monetize them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See you in the Known World!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brave the Known World and lead one of five asymmetric races to vanquish your enemies and push back the Timefront. Recruit, combat and expand your territory in this thrilling new take on the old and beloved genre.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cinematic Campaign</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/80d4cb99c7a9c3359f7b8f16c9056dec.poster.avif?t=1750949587\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/80d4cb99c7a9c3359f7b8f16c9056dec.webm?t=1750949587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/80d4cb99c7a9c3359f7b8f16c9056dec.mp4?t=1750949587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself on a rich, character-driven story and fight back against Oroch to reclaim the lands lost to the Timefront. This roguelike campaign will ensure replayability is fresh and engaging in every run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Own Strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/ec70e2181292258bab4cdf770eba01ca.poster.avif?t=1750949587\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/ec70e2181292258bab4cdf770eba01ca.webm?t=1750949587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/ec70e2181292258bab4cdf770eba01ca.mp4?t=1750949587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your race, commander, units and artifacts to customize your own playstyle before the game begins. Tweak your composition after every match to min/max your strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/eab6f97b9d772f943df09783b1d3cc39.poster.avif?t=1750949587\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/eab6f97b9d772f943df09783b1d3cc39.webm?t=1750949587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/eab6f97b9d772f943df09783b1d3cc39.mp4?t=1750949587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills on casual skirmishes against players from around the world. You can take it one step further and try the competitive ladder and tournaments for rewards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Raids</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/32dcff788b32266b5a46d4b81239e491.poster.avif?t=1750949587\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/32dcff788b32266b5a46d4b81239e491.webm?t=1750949587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/32dcff788b32266b5a46d4b81239e491.mp4?t=1750949587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Party-up with your friends or guildmates to overcome difficult scenarios against the AI in this challenging co-op game mode.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Custom Games</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/d1548bc8058e546f583ed6c9598af17d.poster.avif?t=1750949587\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/d1548bc8058e546f583ed6c9598af17d.webm?t=1750949587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/d1548bc8058e546f583ed6c9598af17d.mp4?t=1750949587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Worldshaper, Timefront's game editor, to build your own custom games and publish them. If they become popular with the community, you can monetize them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See you in the Known World!</p>",
    "short_description": "Timefront is a high-fantasy, real-time strategy game with innovative gameplay mechanics. Explore the story behind the characters on its roguelike campaign, test your skills in multiplayer or play with friends on co-op challenges and custom games. Try this refreshing take on the RTS genre!",
